+# Daily Grind components
+
+Load `components/daily-grind.js` once with a module script. It registers three
+framework-free custom elements. Each owns an open shadow root, clones a shared
+template, and keeps its styles inside that root. No build step is required.
+
+## Content API
+
+- `coffee-card`: provide an `h3` with `slot="heading"`, a paragraph with
+  `slot="description"`, and an anchor with `slot="action"`.
+- `coffee-hero`: use the same slots, with an `h1` for the homepage heading.
+- `grind-navigation`: provide branding with `slot="brand"`, native anchors in
+  the default slot, and an optional anchor with `slot="account-action"`.
+  Each instance manages its own mobile disclosure. The button supports native
+  keyboard activation; Escape closes the menu and returns focus to the button.
+  Listeners are removed on disconnect and restored on reconnect.
+
+Example (use the appropriate heading level for the surrounding page):
+
+```html
+<coffee-card>
+  <h3 slot="heading">House Blend</h3>
+  <p slot="description">A balanced everyday roast.</p>
+  <a slot="action" href="/menu/house-blend"
+     aria-label="View details for House Blend">View Details</a>
+</coffee-card>
+```
+
+Keep slotted content semantic and give repeated action links descriptive
+accessible names. Slots preserve consumer content, including subsequent text
+and link updates. Content and links remain available if JavaScript fails.
+Avoid broad page styles for slotted elements, since consumer styles take
+precedence over `::slotted()` styles.
+
+## Theming
+
+Components inherit the page font, line height, and CSS custom properties.
+Set `--primary`, `--text`, `--accent`, `--focus`, `--card-background`, or
+`--hero-image` (a CSS `url(...)`) on an ancestor or individual component.
+Every property has a default. Use `coffee-card::part(card)` or
+`coffee-hero::part(hero)` for more specific surface customization.
+
+ARIA controls and their targets remain together inside each navigation shadow
+root, so multiple navigation instances can safely use the same internal IDs.
+The hosts do not add extra tab stops; native anchors and the navigation button
+provide keyboard behavior and focus semantics.
